. Medial patello-femoral distance (Media MRI: 15.9 &#x000b1; 2.72 mm, Media US: 16.2 &#x000b1; 2.72 mm). Controls show a statistically significant difference. Medial patello-femoral distance (Media MRI: 8.89 &#x000b1; 1.61 mm, Media US: 9.2 &#x000b1; 1.36 mm).</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><tbody><tr><td colspan="4" align="center" valign="middle" style="border-top:solid thin;border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1">(<bold>A</bold>)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="center" valign="middle" style="border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1">
